# Startup layout: five pre-named tabs in the first OS window.
# Loaded via `startup_session startup.session` in kitty.conf.
# Applies to kitty startup only; a new OS window (Cmd+N) gets one plain tab.
# Tab titles set here are fixed and are not overwritten by the shell.
# Add a `cd <dir>` line above a `launch` to give that tab a working directory.

new_tab work-1
launch

new_tab work-2
launch

new_tab tools
launch

new_tab priv
launch

new_tab temp
launch

focus_tab 0
